    "progressSummary": "COMPLETE (moment half): Lᵖ convergence of sample means forces E[|X₀|ᵖ]<∞, verified in Lean (0 sorry/axiom). Immediate via S₁/1 = X₀; limit-identification c=E[X₀] left as follow-up.",
